  "extract_html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"ib-wrap\" style=\"width:380px\">\n   \n<aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-purple pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"Box title\">Poison Absorption</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/b/b5/Cobradragonforce.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20120812094401\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Cobradragonforce\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/b/b5/Cobradragonforce.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/516?cb=20120812094401\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/b/b5/Cobradragonforce.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/516?cb=20120812094401 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/b/b5/Cobradragonforce.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20120812094401 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Cobradragonforce\" width=\"270\" height=\"298\" data-image-key=\"Cobradragonforce.jpg\" data-image-name=\"Cobradragonforce.jpg\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">As the Poison Dragon Slayer, Cobra (Fairy Tail) can consume various forms of deadly poison.</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Row 1 info\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Power/Ability to:</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Absorb Poison</div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<p>The power to <b>absorb poisons and utilize them in some way</b>. Sub-power of <a href=\"/wiki/Poison_Manipulation\" title=\"Poison Manipulation\">Poison Manipulation</a>. Variation of <a href=\"/wiki/Organic_Absorption\" title=\"Organic Absorption\">Organic Absorption</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Also_Called\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Also Called</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Capabilities\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Capabilities</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Applications\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Applications</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Associations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Associations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Limitations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Limitations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Known_Users\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Users</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Known_Objects\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Objects</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Gallery\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Gallery</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Also_Called\">Also Called</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FPoison_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Poison Consumption</li>\n<li>Toxin/Venom Absorption</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Capabilities\">Capabilities</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FPoison_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The user can absorb poisonous substances, while removing it from the source, into their body and use it in various ways, gaining some form of advantage, either by enhancing themselves, gaining the drained power, using it as power source etc., either temporarily or permanently.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Applications\">Applications</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FPoison_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Assimilation_Shield\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Assimilation Shield\">Assimilation Shield</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Enhanced_Condition\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Enhanced Condition\">Enhanced Condition</a>/<a href=\"/wiki/Supernatural_Condition\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Supernatural Condition\">Supernatural Condition</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Organic_Regeneration\" title=\"Organic Regeneration\">Organic Regeneration</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Poison_Consumption\" title=\"Poison Consumption\">Poison Consumption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Poison_Empowerment\" title=\"Poison Empowerment\">Poison Empowerment</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Associations\">Associations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FPoison_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D4&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Organic_Absorption\" title=\"Organic Absorption\">Organic Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Poison_Immunity\" title=\"Poison Immunity\">Poison Immunity</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Poison_Manipulation\" title=\"Poison Manipulation\">Poison Manipulation</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Limitations\">Limitations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FPoison_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D5&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>May be limited to how much one can absorb.</li>\n<li>May have limited range, including touch only.</li>\n<li>May be limited to certain poisons.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorption_Immunity\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Absorption Immunity\">Absorption Immunity</a>/<a href=\"/wiki/Absorption_Negation\" title=\"Absorption Negation\">Absorption Negation</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Known_Users\">Known Users</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FPoison_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D6&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Puenwyn Dragon (<i>Dragon Mania Legends</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://fairytail.fandom.com/wiki/Cobra\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:fairytail:Cobra\">Erik/Cobra</a> (<i>Fairy Tail</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://fairytail.fandom.com/wiki/Mirajane_Strauss\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:fairytail:Mirajane Strauss\">Mirajane Strauss</a> (<i>Fairy Tail</i>)</li>\n<li>Hexxus (<i>Ferngully: the Last Rainforest</i>); via Feeding</li>\n<li>Kang Han Soo (<i>FFF-Class Trashero</i>)</li>\n<li>Cúchulainn the impure (<i>Final Fantasy XII</i>)</li>\n<li>Alejandro Herrera (<i>Heroes</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://infinite-level-up-in-murim.fandom.com/wiki/Ala_Bongdae\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:infinite-level-up-in-murim:Ala Bongdae\">Ala Bongdae</a> (<i>Infinite Leveling: Murim</i>)</li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://namu.wiki/w/%EC%88%98%EB%9D%BC%EC%A0%84%EC%84%A4%20%EB%8F%85%EB%A3%A1/%EB%93%B1%EC%9E%A5%EC%9D%B8%EB%AC%BC#s-2\">Zhen Ziqiang</a> (<i>Legend of Asura – The Venom Dragon</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://onepiece.fandom.com/wiki/Vinsmoke_Reiju\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:onepiece:Vinsmoke Reiju\">Vinsmoke Reiju</a> (<i>One Piece</i>)</li>\n<li>Users of the move \"Purify\" (<i>Pokémon</i>)</li>\n<li>Firo (<i>Rising of the Shield Hero</i>)</li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://scp-int.wikidot.com/scp-042-cs\">SCP-042-CZ - A Formerly Winged Horse</a> (<i>SCP Foundation</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://vampirediaries.fandom.com/wiki/Malachai_Parker\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:vampirediaries:Malachai Parker\">Kai Parker</a> (<i>The Vampire Diaries</i>); via <a href=\"/wiki/Magical_Energy_Absorption\" title=\"Magical Energy Absorption\">Magical Energy Absorption</a> to absorb supernatural poisons</li>\n<li>Dan Mcninja (<i>The Adventures of Dr.Mcninja</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://witchesofeastend.fandom.com/wiki/Frederick_Beauchamp\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:witchesofeastend:Frederick Beauchamp\">Frederick Beauchamp</a> (<i>Witches of East End</i>)</li>\n<li>Harry Greenwood (<i>Charmed 2018 series</i>)</li>\n<li>Shivaay (<i>Hero Gayab Mode On</i>)</li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://soulland.fandom.com/wiki/Tang_San\">Tang San</a> (Soul Land/Doulou Dalu)</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Known_Objects\">Known Objects</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FPoison_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D7&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Poison Blade (<i>Assassin's Creed</i>)</li>\n<li>Hiraikotsu (<i>InuYasha</i>)</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FPoison_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D8&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">